# Allow-list build context: only what the image needs is sent to the builder, so secrets,
# .env files, virtualenvs, caches and test data can never end up in a layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!alembic.ini
!src/
!migrations/
!scripts/export-requirements.sh

# ...and nothing generated inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
